[center][size=6][color=#93c47d][b]CSS Shared Assets v1.0.4[/b][/color][/size][/center]

[b]Added[/b]
[list]
[*]Profane Proxima v0.2.0 (id eins0fx.thornyproxima) gets mouth expressions and facial playback: 20 expressions and all six dance faces.
[*]Genessa's Faithful Doubles and Stray Doubles appear as ghostly copies of Profane Proxima v0.2.0, from 14 new ghost materials in this package.
[/list]

[b]Changed[/b]
[list]
[*]Profane Proxima v0.2.0 keeps the shared animations and walk support it had in v0.1.0.
[*]Every animation and asset from 1.0.3 stays byte for byte the same; the new materials are added beside them.
[/list]

[b]Upgrading[/b]
[list]
[*]Close the game. Replace CSS_SharedAssets_P under MortalShell2/Content/Paks/~mods/ with this full package.
[*]Install CSS 1.0.4 alongside it. Shared Assets is a separate companion download.
[/list]
